  "item_short_desc": "<p>Silence the storm with our Shadow Ops Waterproof Rain Jacket. Unlike the typical bulky rain coat that makes a lot of noise as you move, these high-performance, ultra-light rain jackets remain quiet, provide unparalleled wind and rain protection, and offer extreme comfort. The outdoor jacket has a waterproof rating of 5,000mm that easily endures harsh outdoor weather conditions.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": null,
  "description": "<p>Silence the storm with our Shadow Ops Waterproof Rain Jacket. Unlike the typical bulky rain coat that makes a lot of noise as you move, these high-performance, ultra-light rain jackets remain quiet, provide unparalleled wind and rain protection, and offer extreme comfort. The outdoor jacket has a waterproof rating of 5,000mm that easily endures harsh outdoor weather conditions. Move with Silent Precision: Built to keep you comfortable and on-the move, our Active Flex stretch technology is ready to tackle any challenge, offering flexibility and ease of movement. These raincoats feature a sleek and silent design that utilizes our Shadow Ops fabric that is engineered with waterproof properties and a fabric that is quiet while you move. Storage Pockets: The outdoor rain jacket comes equipped with 2 zippered hand pockets and 2 interior drop pockets. Utility at the Forefront: These raincoats feature a drawstring hood, full-length zipper with a snap-button storm placket, zipper storm guard, adjustable hook &amp; loop cuffs, and a drawstring bottom for keeping wind and rain out. Ready for Action: The lightweight rain jacket is great for field operations, camping, hiking, outdoor work, everyday wear, and more. From the trails to the streets, the rugged rain shell ensures you remain dry and comfortable.</p>",
